WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
What happens when we add negative five to three? Start at three.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Negative five tells us to move five places left.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
One.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Two.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Three.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Four.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Five. We land on negative two.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The plus sign tells us to add. The negative sign on five tells us which direction to move.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Start at negative two. Which direction should you move, and where will you land?
